  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-QZamXJcN\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eTD4odvw\">本章节将帮助您快速了解API相关术语</p></blockquote><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-PCdRKiNG\" id=\"link-0\">APPID</h4><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-11GcD6JF\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dN4kb3w5\"><strong>中文名称</strong>：开发者应用ID</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OQMq42VK\"><strong>详细描述</strong>：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-65lNdHNX\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-R7a2YHLu\">APPID开发者调用接口的基本单元。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-o9VMDdB2\">当您成为开发者之后，需要先申请APPID。登录开放平台，点击【应用管理】，进入APPID管理页面，便可以创建应用（APPID），填写必要内容，然后提交申请，等待审核，审核通过后，您将获取APPID和密钥（<strong>secret</strong>）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HA6h9kNX\">利用APPID及其他参数组合成授权url，您就可以向客户发起授权申请了。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PPH2y8Ds\">每个开发者<strong>最多允许创建10个APPID，不同类型应用具有不同的绑定权限</strong>，我们会按您的实际需求进行审核，请确保应用描述详细和准确。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2iP3jHIh\">授权客户数，包含4挡范围，分别为50、100、300、500等，<strong>默认为可授权50个账号</strong>。如果默认授权数量无法满足您的需求，可向运营对接人提交工单申请。</li></ul><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-082PJuNP%5C%22%3E%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8D%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%90%8E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A1%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kmeqm%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-082PJuNP%5C%22%3E%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%EF%BC%9A%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8D%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E5%90%8E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A1%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-082PJuNP\">说明：以上账号维度不区分类型，例如代理商账号授权后授权数量记为绑定1个，但是可以操作代理商下的所有投放账户</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-WkhKnDkV\"><br></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-86h5ci0m\" id=\"link-1\">secret</h4><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-iIZOQTPL\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-CZc28wtR\"><strong>中文名称</strong>：应用密钥</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-xHaApHuH\"><strong>详细描述</strong>：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-SDLQecBL\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-p0StEk7q\"><strong>每一个应用（APPID）都对应唯一的密钥</strong>，当应用通过审核后会同时获得的APPID和密钥。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tgEuF4yY\">secret用于<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">获取 Access Token</span></a>&nbsp;以及<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506574848\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">获取已授权账户</span></a>。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-EzOyMCMm\"><br></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-mgASDeaM\" id=\"link-2\">callback address</h4><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-05kDdMG8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-87b2WzuS\"><strong>中文名称</strong>：应用回调地址</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jtNch2W1\"><strong>详细描述</strong>：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-BEmiQbm0\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2kCnFnv3\">每个应用都有一个回调地址，<strong>用于授权成功后将授权码auth_code以及state回调给开发者</strong>。</li></ul><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-bhXUS0Ml%5C%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%3Cstrong%3E%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%3C%2Fstrong%3E%E3%80%82%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83URL%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%20%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fmarketing_api%2Fauth%3Fapp_id%3DXXX%26amp%3Bstate%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bscope%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bredirect_uri%3D%25E2%2580%258B%25E2%2580%258B%25E2%2580%258B%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fmarketing_api%2Fauth%3Fapp_id%3DXXX%26amp%3Bstate%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bscope%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bredirect_uri%3D%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%20Callback%20address%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22090bN%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-bhXUS0Ml%5C%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%3Cstrong%3E%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%3C%2Fstrong%3E%E3%80%82%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83URL%E7%9A%84%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%20%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fmarketing_api%2Fauth%3Fapp_id%3DXXX%26amp%3Bstate%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bscope%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bredirect_uri%3D%25E2%2580%258B%25E2%2580%258B%25E2%2580%258B%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fmarketing_api%2Fauth%3Fapp_id%3DXXX%26amp%3Bstate%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bscope%3Dxxx%26amp%3Bredirect_uri%3D%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%20Callback%20address%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bhXUS0Ml\">注意：<strong>需要确保回调地址能够成功接收回调信息</strong>。授权URL的形式如： <a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/marketing_api/auth?app_id=XXX&amp;state=xxx&amp;scope=xxx&amp;redirect_uri=%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B\" target=\"_blank\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/marketing_api/auth?app_id=XXX&amp;state=xxx&amp;scope=xxx&amp;redirect_uri=</a> Callback address</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-kVszgX1S\"><br></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-oAiegDm3\" id=\"link-3\">scope</h4><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-QMimiYbB\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pqFisiUP\"><strong>中文名称</strong>：接口权限点</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mh8XoYmb\"><strong>详细描述</strong>：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-JPcVNjJm\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kx5jI2iL\">授权的接口权限范围。主要用于申请客户授权时，授权链接中拼接接口权限参数Scope，不传则代表获取当前应用（APPID）拥有的所有权限。</li></ul><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%